icles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNQ1hjZVRoTjU0NzBrVnFTY01pVGdVeE9RempTeDFQRi1BNVhqbF9EcEc2QnZWZXIzSDlZME5jWm5zR2ZlYmMySnhydW1DZm0ta3dVNzVZdS1QQ0pibEdpcjZnbXFRSWJDWTlBSFh2YkhwOEtQTDZOaFVFOGZFUjNLLVpHWU5aLWlER1JjUmNzVzlzSW5BeHZRNU9FVnlLeEN2NGtoQlkyaURWdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"11 月 19 日，United Rentals 舉辦「藍色星期四」二手設備促銷活動，享受大優惠！"},{"title":"United Rentals subsidiary prices $2.5B debt deal","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNdGdCSUZnaHo4NlNvTFJwNnREQ3M4cnk4Mlk0dkJBczBPQlpGWGcwMWlGSGtWQ3I0VVhSRnMxa29PX0RwNEpqcXFkbkNfeUVuSDBsR0Zsek5YMjVnRG9YT1R5azBjUnhIVW00dEFtS19vRldiSktaajc0MUp2N1lQOGJuSHl4QV8zLXZ5dzNGdUZrNG8wOGprYTM1N253elhLaXE2c0dieFhWd2tON0pj?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"United Rentals 子公司定價 $2.5B 債務交易"},{"title":"United Rentals (NYSE:URI) - Análisis de acciones","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"United Rentals (NYSE:URI) - 產業分析"},{"title":"How Do Custom Truck One Source (NYSE:CTOS), United Rentals (NYSE:URI) and Huntington Ingalls Industries (NYSE:HII) News Items Compare?","src":"Kalkine","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Custom Truck One Source (NYSE:CTOS)、United Rentals (NYSE:URI) 和 Huntington Ingalls Industries (NYSE:HII) 新聞項目如何比較？"},{"title":"Is Raised Revenue Guidance Altering The Investment Case For United Rentals Stock?","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"提高收入指引是否會改變聯合租賃股票的投資理由？"},{"title":"United Rentals Inc (URI) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Rec","src":"GuruFocus","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"United Rentals Inc (URI)（2026 年第 3 季）收益電話會議亮點：Rec"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-28","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1067701/000106770126000007/uri-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"United Rentals is the largest equipment rental company in the world, operates throughout the United States and Canada, and has a smaller presence in Europe, Australia and New Zealand. The table below presents key information about our business as of and for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024. Our business is discussed in more detail below. The data below should be read in conjunction with, and is qualified by reference to, our Management's Discussion and Analysis and our consolidated financial statements and notes thereto contained elsewhere in this report.","zh":"United Rentals 是世界上最大的設備租賃公司，業務遍及美國和加拿大，在歐洲、澳洲和紐西蘭的業務規模較小。下表列出了截至2025年12月31日和2024年12月31日止年度有關我們業務的關鍵資訊。以下將更詳細地討論我們的業務。以下數據應與我們管理層的討論和分析以及本報告其他部分所載的合併財務報表和附註一起閱讀，並透過參考進行限定。"},{"en":"(2)Reflects the combined impact of changes in rental rates, time utilization, and mix that contribute to the variance in owned equipment rental revenue. See note 3 to the consolidated financial statements for a discussion of the different types of equipment rentals revenue. Rental rate changes are calculated based on the year-over-year variance in average contract rates, weighted by the prior period revenue mix. Time utilization is calculated by dividing the amount of time an asset is","zh":"(2) 反映租金率、時間利用率和組合變化的綜合影響，這些變化導致自有設備租賃收入的差異。有關不同類型設備租賃收入的討論，請參閱合併財務報表附註 3。租金率變化是根據平均合約費率的同比差異計算的，並按前期收入組合加權。時間利用率的計算方法是除以資產所使用的時間量"},{"en":"on rent by the amount of time the asset has been owned during the year. Mix includes the impact of changes in customer, fleet, geographic and segment mix.","zh":"租金是根據一年內擁有資產的時間計算。組合包括客戶、機隊、地理和細分市場組合變化的影響。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Equipment Rental. We offer a fleet of rental equipment with total OEC of $22.5 billion for rent on an hourly, daily, weekly or monthly basis. The types of equipment that we offer include general construction and industrial equipment; aerial work platforms; trench safety equipment; power and HVAC equipment; fluid solutions equipment; mobile storage equipment and modular office space; surface protection mats; and general tools and light equipment.","zh":"設備租賃。我們提供一系列租賃設備，按小時、按天、按週或按月出租，總 OEC 達 225 億美元。我們提供的設備類型包括一般建築設備和工業設備；高空作業平台；溝渠安全設備；電力和暖通空調設備；流體解決方案設備；移動儲存設備和模組化辦公空間；表面保護墊；以及一般工具和輕型設備。"},{"en":"Sales of Rental Equipment. We routinely sell used rental equipment and invest in new equipment in order to manage repair and maintenance costs, as well as the composition and size of our fleet. We also sell used equipment in response to customer demand for the equipment. Consistent with the life-cycle approach we use to manage our fleet, the rate at which we replace used equipment with new equipment depends on a number of factors, including changing general economic conditions, growth opportunities, the market for used equipment, the age of our fleet and the need to adjust fleet composition to meet customer demand.","zh":"租賃設備的銷售。我們通常會出售二手租賃設備並投資新設備，以管理維修和保養成本以及車隊的組成和規模。我們也根據客戶對設備的需求銷售二手設備。與我們用於管理機隊的生命週期方法一致，我們用新設備更換舊設備的速度取決於許多因素，包括不斷變化的總體經濟狀況、增長機會、二手設備市場、我們機隊的年齡以及調整機隊構成以滿足客戶需求的需要。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our customer base is highly diversified and ranges from Fortune 500 companies to small businesses and homeowners. Our customer base varies by branch and is determined by several factors, including the equipment mix and marketing focus of the particular branch as well as the business composition of the local economy, including construction opportunities with different customers. Our customers include:","zh":"我們的客戶群高度多元化，涵蓋從財富 500 強公司到小型企業和房主。我們的客戶群因分公司而異，並由多種因素決定，包括特定分公司的設備組合和行銷重點以及當地經濟的業務組成，包括不同客戶的建設機會。我們的客戶包括："},{"en":"construction companies that use equipment for constructing and renovating commercial buildings, warehouses, industrial and manufacturing plants, office parks, airports, residential developments and other facilities;","zh":"使用設備建造和翻新商業建築、倉庫、工業和製造工廠、辦公園區、機場、住宅開發和其他設施的建築公司；"}],"competition":[{"en":"We primarily operate in the United States and Canada, and have a smaller presence in Europe, Australia and New Zealand. The North American equipment rental industry is highly fragmented and competitive.","zh":"我們主要在美國和加拿大開展業務，在歐洲、澳洲和紐西蘭也有少量業務。北美設備租賃產業高度分散且競爭激烈。"},{"en":"As the largest equipment rental company in the industry, we estimate that we have an approximate 15 percent market share in North America based on 2025 total equipment rental industry revenues (excluding party and event rentals) as measured by the ARA. Estimated market share is calculated by dividing our total 2025 North American rental revenue by ARA's forecasted 2025 industry revenue (excluding party and event rentals). Our competitors primarily include small, independent businesses with one or two rental locations; regional competitors that operate in one or more states; public companies or divisions of public companies that operate nationally or internationally; and equipment vendors and dealers who both sell and rent equipment directly to customers. We believe we are well positioned to take advantage of this environment because, as a larger company, we have more resources and certai","zh":"作為業內最大的設備租賃公司，根據 ARA 衡量的 2025 年設備租賃行業總收入（不包括派對和活動租賃），我們估計我們在北美擁有約 15% 的市場份額。估計市場佔有率的計算方法是將 2025 年北美租賃總收入除以 ARA 預測的 2025 年行業收入（不包括派對和活動租賃）。我們的競爭對手主要包括擁有一兩個租賃地點的小型獨立企業；在一個或多個州運營的區域競爭對手；在國內或國際運營的上市公司或上市公司的部門；直接向客戶銷售和租賃設備的設備供應商和經銷商。我們相信，我們有能力利用這種環境，因為作為一家更大的公司，我們擁有更多的資源和某些"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"General Rentals","val":11001000000,"zh":"一般租賃部門"},{"name":"Specialty","val":5098000000,"zh":"專業部門"}],"total":16099000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Equipment Rental Revenue","val":13806000000,"zh":"設備租賃收入"},{"name":"Owned Equipment Rentals","val":11048000000,"zh":"自有設備租賃"},{"name":"Ancillaryand Other Rental Revenue","val":2483000000,"zh":"輔助和其他租金收入"},{"name":"Rental Equipment","val":1413000000,"zh":"租賃設備"},{"name":"Other Rental Revenue","val":1330000000,"zh":"其他租金收入"},{"name":"Delivery & Pick Up","val":1153000000,"zh":"送貨及取貨"},{"name":"Serviceand Other Revenues","val":369000000,"zh":"服務和其他收入"},{"name":"New Equipment","val":348000000,"zh":"新設備"},{"name":"Rerent Revenue","val":275000000,"zh":"租金收入"},{"name":"Contractor Supplies","val":163000000,"zh":"承包商用品"}],"total":16099000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":14671000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1428000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":16099000000}},"peers":["MLM","VMC","PWR","TDG","ULTA"]}}